			"updated": 1770303720803,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Vertical scaling means increasing the capacity of a single machine by upgrading its\nresources.\n\nYou upgrade things like:\n\nMore CPU cores\nFaster CPU\nMore RAM\nFaster disk (SSD, NVMe)\nBetter network card\n\n",
			"rawText": "Vertical scaling means increasing the capacity of a single machine by upgrading its resources.\n\nYou upgrade things like:\n\nMore CPU cores\nFaster CPU\nMore RAM\nFaster disk (SSD, NVMe)\nBetter network card\n\n",
