			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1770303391791,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "CPU BottleNeck4-core machine\n\nCPU capacity = 4 × 1000 = 4000 ms/sec\nEach request = 20 ms CPU\n\nMax RPS = 4000 / 20 = 200 RPS\n\nUpgrade to:\n\n8-core machine\nNew CPU capacity = 8 × 1000 = 8000 ms/sec\nNew max RPS = 8000 / 20 = 400 RPS\n",
			"rawText": "CPU BottleNeck4-core machine\n\nCPU capacity = 4 × 1000 = 4000 ms/sec\nEach request = 20 ms CPU\n\nMax RPS = 4000 / 20 = 200 RPS\n\nUpgrade to:\n\n8-core machine\nNew CPU capacity = 8 × 1000 = 8000 ms/sec\nNew max RPS = 8000 / 20 = 400 RPS\n",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "i42sT7In",
			"originalText": "CPU BottleNeck4-core machine\n\nCPU capacity = 4 × 1000 = 4000 ms/sec\nEach request = 20 ms CPU\n\nMax RPS = 4000 / 20 = 200 RPS\n\nUpgrade to:\n\n8-core machine\nNew CPU capacity = 8 × 1000 = 8000 ms/sec\nNew max RPS = 8000 / 20 = 400 RPS\n",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
