			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1770303516092,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "\nMemory bottleneck happens when:\n\nRAM is full\n\nSystem starts swapping\nCache gets evicted too often\nVertical scaling solutions:\n\nAdd more RAM\n\nUse bigger memory-optimized machine\n\nExample:\n\nServer has 8 GB RAM\nCache needs 12 GB",
			"rawText": "\nMemory bottleneck happens when:\n\nRAM is full\n\nSystem starts swapping\nCache gets evicted too often\nVertical scaling solutions:\n\nAdd more RAM\n\nUse bigger memory-optimized machine\n\nExample:\n\nServer has 8 GB RAM\nCache needs 12 GB",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "Vz3DhLStqLijWz_7X2EO9",
			"originalText": "\nMemory bottleneck happens when:\n\nRAM is full\n\nSystem starts swapping\nCache gets evicted too often\nVertical scaling solutions:\n\nAdd more RAM\n\nUse bigger memory-optimized machine\n\nExample:\n\nServer has 8 GB RAM\nCache needs 12 GB",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
