			"updated": 1770303517904,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Network bottleneck happens when:\n\nNIC is saturated\nBandwidth limit is hit\nPacket queues build up\n\nVertical scaling solutions:\n\nUpgrade to higher bandwidth NIC\nUse instance types with better network throughput\n\nExample:\n\nBefore:\n1 Gbps NIC\nTraffic needs = 3 Gbps",
			"rawText": "Network bottleneck happens when:\n\nNIC is saturated\nBandwidth limit is hit\nPacket queues build up\n\nVertical scaling solutions:\n\nUpgrade to higher bandwidth NIC\nUse instance types with better network throughput\n\nExample:\n\nBefore:\n1 Gbps NIC\nTraffic needs = 3 Gbps",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "ASj6m8eNwCMwzJEB0QI1q",
			"originalText": "Network bottleneck happens when:\n\nNIC is saturated\nBandwidth limit is hit\nPacket queues build up\n\nVertical scaling solutions:\n\nUpgrade to higher bandwidth NIC\nUse instance types with better network throughput\n\nExample:\n\nBefore:\n1 Gbps NIC\nTraffic needs = 3 Gbps",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
