			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1770304628350,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "LIMITATIONS\n\nVertical scaling has hard limits:\n\nMax CPU cores per machine\nMax RAM per machine\nHardware becomes very expensive\nSingle point of failure\n\nDowntime during upgrades\n\nExample:\n\nYou can go from:\n\n4 cores → 8 → 16 → 32\n\nBut you cannot go to infinite\ncores.",
			"rawText": "LIMITATIONS\n\nVertical scaling has hard limits:\n\nMax CPU cores per machine\nMax RAM per machine\nHardware becomes very expensive\nSingle point of failure\n\nDowntime during upgrades\n\nExample:\n\nYou can go from:\n\n4 cores → 8 → 16 → 32\n\nBut you cannot go to infinite cores.",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "rhV73miL",
			"originalText": "LIMITATIONS\n\nVertical scaling has hard limits:\n\nMax CPU cores per machine\nMax RAM per machine\nHardware becomes very expensive\nSingle point of failure\n\nDowntime during upgrades\n\nExample:\n\nYou can go from:\n\n4 cores → 8 → 16 → 32\n\nBut you cannot go to infinite cores.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
